            <name>AddRow</name>
            <comment>Add a row to the table.
values: cell texts
hAligns: per-cell horizontal alignment (LEFT/CENTER/RIGHT). 
                 Pass null to use the table default. 
                 Pass an array with 1 element to apply the same alignment to all cells.
colors: per-cell text color (#RRGGBB).
                 Pass null to use the table default text color.
                 Pass an array with 1 element to apply the same color to all cells.</comment>
